          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 148 for back. Front halves: chain 75 each. Establish cable repeat. Cable-cross every 6th row. Work for 81.7 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sleeves (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chain 56. Work cable repeat, increasing each end every 4 rows for 63.3 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
